graph TD
    A[User Message] --> B[Memory System]

    B --> C[Short-term Memory<br/>Last 10 messages<br/>in context window]
    B --> D[Medium-term Memory<br/>Session summary<br/>in vector DB]
    B --> E[Long-term Memory<br/>User facts & history<br/>in database]

    C --> F[Current Conversation Context]
    D --> G[Semantic Retrieval:<br/>Relevant past interactions]
    E --> H[User Profile:<br/>Preferences, issues, etc.]

    F --> I[Agent processes<br/>with full context]
    G --> I
    H --> I

    I --> J[Agent Response]
    J --> K[Update Memories]

    K --> L[Add to short-term]
    K --> M[Summarize to medium-term]
    K --> N[Extract facts to long-term]

